# Bishon V2 — Huawei Ascend (CANN) runtime image.
#
# STATUS: PLACEHOLDER. Not implemented in this round.
#
# When implementing:
#   - Base image: ascend/cann:<version>-ubuntu22.04 (or official Huawei base)
#   - Install CANN toolkit + Python wheels for torch-npu / mindspore if used
#   - Replace `--gpus all` in bishon-start.sh with `--device /dev/davinci0`
#     (or `--device /dev/davinciX` for multi-card) plus required CANN env vars
#   - The python-env in the release tarball must be rebuilt against the same
#     CANN version (faiss-cpu is fine; paddlepaddle + torch need NPU builds)
#
# Build with: bash scripts/docker/bishon-build.sh --version <ver> --accelerator ascend
# (after this Dockerfile is filled in)
